--- Standard Python / macOS / Windows Ignore File ---

This file tells Git to ignore temporary files, build artifacts, and local configurations.

Byte-compiled files

*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
pycache/

Python environment directories (Crucial for keeping your repo clean!)

.venv/
venv/
env/

Database files

*.db
*.sqlite3

--- IDE and OS-specific files ---

macOS system files

.DS_Store

Windows system files

Thumbs.db

PyCharm/IntelliJ project files (local configuration)

.idea/
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr

VS Code project files (local configuration)

.vscode/

Build artifacts

dist/
build/

